ression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and uncover hidden areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration rewards you with new gear, permanent stat boosts, and hidden surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 optional challenges that award points to spend on permanent unlockable content such as accessories, equipment parts, and costumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon is viable and can be upgraded and customized to suit your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unlockable costumes, from casual to classy, and everywhere in between</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new difficulties with remixed enemies and item placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in randomizer for endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game Plus lets you keep leveling and hunting down what you missed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with controller and playable on Steam Deck</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dead Right Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767530/c5de5a6e22d2252f5646b09f3f814637d19d07dc/header.jpg?t=1763112388","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2767530/733691838/db6cfef8208373e5eaeaefc4042c66a0da6adfb9/1762689413/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763112387","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2767530/733691838/db6cfef8208373e5eaeaefc4042c66a0da6adfb9/1762689413/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763112387","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai